<p>Improves your ghoulish body, increasing Strength and Constitution by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 6, 10, 13, 15.</acronym></p><p>Your body also becomes incredibly resilient to damage; you can never take a blow that deals more than 50% of your maximum life.</p>